Fj4Pp8tSWAxUsQ_UHHcGXBGwQ3IcHCIABKAs",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_WAIT_TIME"],"候位時間多久？",[[[["E:DINING_WAIT_TIME_UP_TO_10_MIN"],"最多 10 分鐘",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwiFj4Pp8tSWAxUsQ_UHHcGXBGwQ3YcHCIMBKAA"]],1],null,null,"等待時間",null,"0ahUKEwiFj4Pp8tSWAxUsQ_UHHcGXBGwQ3IcHCIIBKAw",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["是好吃的拉麵！\n這次點了豚骨拉麵跟蛤蜊雞白湯拉麵（看到剩下三碗，就被吸引過去了）\n先用點餐機付費點餐後等待店員帶位，這間店肯定要大大加分的就是座位間距非常舒服，可以讓人吃得很自在。\n麵條部分是細麵，不過可以免費加半球或一球，直接跟店員告知即可，店員注意到麵是點軟的，也會直接把加麵註記是軟的，這點很用心。\n豚骨拉麵的湯頭溫潤厚實，蛤蠣雞白湯則有著明顯的鮮味，湯頭真的是好喝。加麵一球會另外給，給的麵量感覺比原本碗裡的量還要多，所以份量絕對不用擔心。\n看到在場很多客人都有點叉燒飯，下次可以嘗試，不過吃習慣比較清淡的，湯頭對於腸胃還是油膩了些，吃清淡的人可能要再評估一下。",null,[0,90]]]],[],[null,null,13926,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2kwd1ZVaHphWGhRWlVKeUxVRk1jWGRPV0hweGNVRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x5547712cc123659b!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOi0wVUhzaXhQZUJyLUFMcXdOWHpxcUE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2kwd1ZVaHphWGhRWlVKeUxVRk1jWGRPV0hweGNVRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2kwd1ZVaHphWGhRWlVKeUxVRk1jWGRPV0hweGNVRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2kwd1ZVaHphWGhRWlVKeUxVRk1jWGRPV0hweGNVRRILMGNvRkNvaEMtTXQaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09pMHdWVWh6YVhoUVpVSnlMVUZNY1hkT1dIcHhjVUUSCzBjb0ZDb2hDLU10IhIJAAAAAAAAAAARm2UjwSxxR1UqCzBjb0ZDb2hDLU10\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwiFj4Pp8tSWAxUsQ_UHHcGXBGwQoykIhAEoDQ"],null,[null,[[1,0]]]],"0ahUKEwi89Ijp8tSWAxWU6IsBHQBhEakQ0pMFCD8oAg"],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwiFj4Pp8tSWAxUsQ_UHHcGXBGwQ0pMFCG0oAg"],[["Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2sxMmVDMUdOMDFmWlVkaWJWcFNWRmwzVVdGU2FsRRAB",["0x0:0x5547712cc123659b",null,1762771283618887,1762771283618887,[null,null,["https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111958492516410604115/reviews?hl\u003dzh-TW"],null,null,["caicai bichon","https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWBj5ETmlYw-QfVd7PGyNX-EOf-TZ81tRC1EKVIofduBAEbBg8f\u003ds120-c-rp-mo-ba1